## Benefits

✅ **Single Source of Truth**: App-to-component mapping defined once  
✅ **No Desynchronization**: Both components import from same config  
✅ **Easy Maintenance**: Add/update apps in one place  
✅ **Scalability**: Simple to extend with new apps  
✅ **Clean Code**: Eliminates duplicate imports and mappings
